---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Cybersecurity Virtual Labs & Practice Range | Aimad Ul Islam
description: Comprehensive collection of hands-on virtual lab environments, Packet Tracer topologies, TryHackMe, Hack The Box, and Blue Team exercises by Aimad Ul Islam.
---

<!-- HERO SECTION -->
<section id="blog-hero" aria-labelledby="labs-hero-title" style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
  <canvas id="blog-hero-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="blog-hero-inner container">
    <div class="blog-hero-eye"><i class="fa-solid fa-flask-vial"></i> Interactive Cyber Training Range</div>
    <h1 class="blog-hero-title" id="labs-hero-title">
      Virtual <span class="accent">Cybersecurity Labs</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="blog-hero-sub">Hands-on threat simulation, PCAP analysis, Blue Team incident response, Packet Tracer network design, and offensive security exercises.</p>

    <!-- Lab Stats -->
    <div class="sidebar-stats-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); max-width: 800px; margin: 1.5rem auto 2rem auto;">
      <div class="s-stat-box card">
        <div class="s-stat-val">{{ labs.items.length + collections.labs.length }}</div>
        <div class="s-stat-lbl">Active Labs</div>
      </div>
      <div class="s-stat-box card">
        <div class="s-stat-val" style="color: var(--cyan);">100%</div>
        <div class="s-stat-lbl">Documented</div>
      </div>
      <div class="s-stat-box card">
        <div class="s-stat-val">5</div>
        <div class="s-stat-lbl">Platforms</div>
      </div>
      <div class="s-stat-box card">
        <div class="s-stat-val" style="color: var(--green);">Ready</div>
        <div class="s-stat-lbl">Download Configs</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Search & Filters -->
    <div class="search-filter-container card">
      <div class="search-wrap" role="search">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <input type="search" id="lab-search" placeholder="Search labs by platform (HTB, THM, VirtualBox), tools (Wireshark, Splunk), or topic..." autocomplete="off" aria-label="Search labs"/>
      </div>

      <div class="filter-controls-row">
        <div class="filter-group">
          <label for="platform-select"><i class="fa-solid fa-server"></i> Platform:</label>
          <select id="platform-select" class="cyber-select">
            <option value="all">All Platforms</option>
            <option value="blue team labs">Blue Team Labs</option>
            <option value="tryhackme">TryHackMe</option>
            <option value="hack the box">Hack The Box</option>
            <option value="portswigger">PortSwigger</option>
            <option value="virtualbox">VirtualBox / Home Lab</option>
            <option value="cisco">Cisco Packet Tracer</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="filter-group">
          <label for="lab-diff-select"><i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high"></i> Difficulty:</label>
          <select id="lab-diff-select" class="cyber-select">
            <option value="all">All Difficulties</option>
            <option value="beginner">Beginner</option>
            <option value="intermediate">Intermediate</option>
            <option value="advanced">Advanced</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Category Pills -->
    <div id="categories-bar" class="categories-bar-wrapper">
      <div class="categories-scroll" role="list">
        <button class="cat-btn active" data-cat="all" role="listitem"><i class="fa-solid fa-border-all fa-xs"></i> All Exercises</button>
        <button class="cat-btn" data-cat="blue team" role="listitem"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved fa-xs"></i> Blue Team & DFIR</button>
        <button class="cat-btn" data-cat="tryhackme" role="listitem"><i class="fa-solid fa-crosshairs fa-xs"></i> TryHackMe</button>
        <button class="cat-btn" data-cat="hack the box" role="listitem"><i class="fa-solid fa-box fa-xs"></i> Hack The Box</button>
        <button class="cat-btn" data-cat="portswigger" role="listitem"><i class="fa-solid fa-bug fa-xs"></i> PortSwigger Web</button>
        <button class="cat-btn" data-cat="virtualbox" role="listitem"><i class="fa-solid fa-desktop fa-xs"></i> VirtualBox / VMware</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
<main class="container">
  <section id="labs-section" class="articles-main-section">
    <div class="section-flex-header">
      <h2 class="articles-section-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i> Cybersecurity Lab Index</h2>
      <span class="posts-count-badge" id="labs-count">Showing All Labs</span>
    </div>

    <div id="labs-grid" class="articles-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr));">
      
      <!-- Data items from JSON -->
      {% for lab in labs.items %}
      <article class="card article-card lab-card"
               data-platform="{{ (lab.platform or 'Virtual Lab') | lower }}"
               data-name="{{ lab.name | lower }}"
               data-description="{{ lab.description | lower }}"
               data-tools="{% if lab.tools %}{% for t in lab.tools %}{{ t | lower }} {% endfor %}{% endif %}"
               data-tags="{% if lab.tags %}{% for t in lab.tags %}{{ t | lower }} {% endfor %}{% endif %}">
        <div class="card-glow"></div>
        <div class="article-card-img-wrap" style="height: 170px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,212,255,0.1), rgba(124,58,237,0.15));">
          <div class="article-card-img-placeholder" style="background: none;">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-flask-vial text-cyan" style="font-size: 2.8rem;"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="card-diff-badge intermediate">{{ lab.platform or "Virtual Lab" }}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="article-card-body">
          <div class="article-card-tags">
            <span class="tag tag-cyber"><i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i> {{ lab.platform }}</span>
            <span class="tag tag-tut"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Verified Lab</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="article-card-title">{{ lab.name }}</h3>
          <p class="article-card-excerpt">{{ lab.description }}</p>

          {% if lab.tools %}
          <div class="article-tags-mini" style="margin-top: 0.8rem;">
            {% for tool in lab.tools %}
            <span class="mini-tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-wrench fa-xs"></i> {{ tool }}</span>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="article-card-footer" style="margin-top: 1.2rem;">
            {% if lab.writeup_url %}
            <a href="{{ lab.writeup_url }}" class="btn btn-sm btn-cyan btn-full"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> Read Writeup Guide</a>
            {% else %}
            <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-full" disabled><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i> Writeup Confidential</button>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}

      <!-- Markdown Collection Items from Decap CMS -->
      {% for lab in collections.labs %}
      <article class="card article-card lab-card"
               data-platform="{{ (lab.data.platform or lab.data.category or 'Virtual Lab') | lower }}"
               data-name="{{ (lab.data.title or lab.data.name) | lower }}"
               data-description="{{ (lab.data.description or '') | lower }}"
               data-tools="{% if lab.data.tools %}{% for t in lab.data.tools %}{{ t | lower }} {% endfor %}{% endif %}"
               data-difficulty="{{ (lab.data.difficulty or 'intermediate') | lower }}"
               onclick="window.location='{{ lab.url }}'">
        <div class="card-glow"></div>
        <div class="article-card-img-wrap" style="height: 170px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,255,136,0.1), rgba(0,212,255,0.15));">
          <div class="article-card-img-placeholder" style="background: none;">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-server text-cyan" style="font-size: 2.8rem;"></i>
          </div>
          <span class="card-diff-badge {{ (lab.data.difficulty or 'Intermediate') | lower }}">{{ lab.data.difficulty or "Intermediate" }}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="article-card-body">
          <div class="article-card-tags">
            <span class="tag tag-cyber"><i class="fa-solid fa-cubes"></i> {{ lab.data.platform or lab.data.category }}</span>
            <span class="tag tag-tut" style="color: var(--green); border-color: rgba(0,255,136,0.3);"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> {{ lab.data.status or "Active" }}</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="article-card-title">{{ lab.data.title or lab.data.name }}</h3>
          <p class="article-card-excerpt">{{ lab.data.description }}</p>

          {% if lab.data.tools %}
          <div class="article-tags-mini" style="margin-top: 0.8rem;">
            {% for tool in lab.data.tools %}
            <span class="mini-tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-wrench fa-xs"></i> {{ tool }}</span>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="article-card-footer" style="margin-top: 1.2rem;">
            <a href="{{ lab.url }}" class="btn btn-sm btn-cyan btn-full"><i class="fa-solid fa-terminal"></i> View Lab Details</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}

    </div>

    <!-- No Results Fallback -->
    <div class="no-results card" id="no-lab-results" style="display:none; text-align: center; padding: 3rem 1.5rem;">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-vial-circle-check text-cyan" style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"></i>
      <h3>No Lab Environments Match Your Criteria</h3>
      <p>Try clearing search text or selecting a different virtual lab platform.</p>
      <button class="btn btn-cyan mt-3" onclick="resetLabSearch()"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> Reset All Filters</button>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
  const searchInput = document.getElementById("lab-search");
  const platformSelect = document.getElementById("platform-select");
  const diffSelect = document.getElementById("lab-diff-select");
  const catBtns = document.querySelectorAll(".cat-btn");
  const cards = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(".lab-card"));
  const countBadge = document.getElementById("labs-count");
  const noResults = document.getElementById("no-lab-results");

  let currentSearch = "";
  let currentPlatform = "all";
  let currentDiff = "all";
  let currentCat = "all";

  function filterLabs() {
    let visible = 0;

    cards.forEach(card => {
      const name = card.getAttribute("data-name") || "";
      const desc = card.getAttribute("data-description") || "";
      const platform = card.getAttribute("data-platform") || "";
      const tools = card.getAttribute("data-tools") || "";
      const diff = card.getAttribute("data-difficulty") || "";
      const tags = card.getAttribute("data-tags") || "";

      const matchSearch = currentSearch === "" || 
                          name.includes(currentSearch) || 
                          desc.includes(currentSearch) || 
                          platform.includes(currentSearch) || 
                          tools.includes(currentSearch) ||
                          tags.includes(currentSearch);

      const matchPlatform = currentPlatform === "all" || platform.includes(currentPlatform.toLowerCase());
      const matchDiff = currentDiff === "all" || diff.includes(currentDiff.toLowerCase());
      const matchCat = currentCat === "all" || platform.includes(currentCat.toLowerCase()) || tags.includes(currentCat.toLowerCase());

      if (matchSearch && matchPlatform && matchDiff && matchCat) {
        card.style.display = "flex";
        visible++;
      } else {
        card.style.display = "none";
      }
    });

    if (countBadge) countBadge.textContent = `${visible} Virtual Labs Active`;
    if (noResults) noResults.style.display = visible === 0 ? "block" : "none";
  }

  if (searchInput) searchInput.addEventListener("input", (e) => { currentSearch = e.target.value.toLowerCase().trim(); filterLabs(); });
  if (platformSelect) platformSelect.addEventListener("change", (e) => { currentPlatform = e.target.value; filterLabs(); });
  if (diffSelect) diffSelect.addEventListener("change", (e) => { currentDiff = e.target.value; filterLabs(); });

  catBtns.forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener("click", () => {
      catBtns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove("active"));
      btn.classList.add("active");
      currentCat = btn.getAttribute("data-cat");
      filterLabs();
    });
  });

  window.resetLabSearch = () => {
    if (searchInput) searchInput.value = "";
    if (platformSelect) platformSelect.value = "all";
    if (diffSelect) diffSelect.value = "all";
    currentSearch = "";
    currentPlatform = "all";
    currentDiff = "all";
    currentCat = "all";
    catBtns.forEach(b => {
      if (b.getAttribute("data-cat") === "all") b.classList.add("active");
      else b.classList.remove("active");
    });
    filterLabs();
  };
});
</script>
